Old Cargo Ship

  - Extremely low poly;

  - Can be used to trace Comic Book Scenery;

  - Adapted to a real-life proportion of such a ship;

  - Can be a good building block for a more detailed render;

Cactus

  - Model created with 3ds Max 2011;

  - Native Max file setup with V-Ray 2.4 renderer and V-Ray materials;

  - The lighting scene is also included with the model;

  - Unit: millimeters;-In the archive: 

