Minibus
This vehicle well fit perfectly into your project if you need a limited number of polygons.
Advantages:

  - wide selection of formats; 

  - a limited number of polygons; 

  - materials avaliable;

  - game ready.

Limitations:

  - lack of texture;

  - low quality mesh.

If you notice incorrect display of mesh in any of the formats, write me, I will try to fix it.

Game Ready PBR Low Poly 3D Model of an Abandoned Shelter.
Features

  - Scaled 3D Model;

  - Uniform texel density (16 pixels per cm² at 4096x4096);

  - PBR Textures;

  - It's free;

Texture Details

  - The model uses two 4096x4096 textures;

  - Included textures are: Diffuse, Normal, Roughness and Metallic

